WEBVTT

00:00:25.363 --> 00:00:30.172
DC: My greatest weakness would
probably be my quick temper.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.138
I have a short fuse.

00:00:32.162 --> 00:00:35.026
AG: All right, and will that help
or hurt the show?

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.628
Should I be worried
that you're going to throw a chair

00:00:37.652 --> 00:00:38.820
at our producer?

00:00:38.844 --> 00:00:40.773
DC: No, no, no, definitely won't happen.

00:00:40.797 --> 00:00:43.255
But sometimes,
when I'm super stressed out,

00:00:43.279 --> 00:00:45.551
the worst version of myself comes out.

00:00:45.575 --> 00:00:46.753
AG: Wow, OK.

00:00:47.682 --> 00:00:50.698
Well, you are unusually honest,
if nothing else.

00:00:50.722 --> 00:00:51.877
DC: Yes.

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:54.051
AG: I don't think I got
a copy of your resume.

00:00:54.075 --> 00:00:55.678
How poorly did you do in school?

00:00:55.702 --> 00:00:56.885
DC: Pretty bad.

00:00:56.909 --> 00:00:59.805
So I graduated with a C-plus from college,

00:00:59.829 --> 00:01:02.378
with a degree in religion, of all things.